5,1,1,talk,Shion,,"Since the room is currently failing to serve all its purposes, we should be logical about this. I suggest we analyze the actual usage and the physical environment first.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I agree. It's probably best to see how we've actually been using the space before we decide. Maybe that would help us find a fair solution for everyone.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Rin,,I agree! Let's be like detectives and find out what's really happening in there. I want to know who is actually using it and if it's even clean!,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Servas,,It is wise to seek the truth of the matter first. Let us look beyond the surface to see how this space truly affects our spirits and our connections. I am ready to explore.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"I agree with the need for data. To ensure we don't create a system that wastes our time or resources, we should look at the practical costs and the actual frequency of use.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shion,,"Since we are in agreement, let's be specific. I'll take the partition wall to the office and the crumbs and bins at the desks. I want to see exactly how the environment is leaking into our workspace.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"Um... if we're looking at costs, maybe I should check the invoices for outside hire by the hour? And... maybe the quotes for the two fit-outs too? I just want to be sure about the numbers.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Rin,,I'll take the fortnight's tally of use by person! And I want to see the final clear-out of the old fridge. I bet there's something super gross in there!,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Servas,,"I shall look into where the last awkward conversation happened and the unplanned talk since the refit. It is often in the quiet, unplanned moments that the true heart of a community is revealed.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Toshio,,I will look into the facilities callouts on this floor and the round trip for a hot lunch. I want to see how much effort is actually spent on maintenance and logistics.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shion,,"It seems we have a comprehensive list covered. @Daisuke, @Rin, @Servas, @Toshio—since we've all claimed our two items, I believe we have everything we need to proceed to the investigation phase.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Rin"",""Servas"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I... I think so too. I hope the information I find is actually useful for everyone. I'll do my best to be thorough with the figures.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Rin,,"Yay! I'm so excited to see what's in that fridge! I'll be the best detective ever and find all the clues! Let's go, let's go!","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Servas,,"Patience is a virtue, Rin. Let us approach this with open hearts. I believe the answers we find will guide us toward a space that nourishes not just our work, but our souls.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Toshio,,Let's proceed then. I look forward to seeing how the data aligns with our current perceptions of the room's utility.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Shion,,"Since we have our assignments, there is no need for further chatter. Let us move to the investigation. I expect a logical synthesis of these findings when we return.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,Okay... I'll go check those documents now. I hope the costs aren't too high... I'll see you all soon.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Rin,,I'm on it! I'm going to find all the secrets! See you guys in a bit! Bye-bye!,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Servas,,"Go in peace, my friends. May your discoveries bring us closer to a harmony that serves us all. I shall await your return with a hopeful heart.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Toshio,,Understood. I will gather the information and return.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
