60,3,1,talk,Shion,,"Given the evidence, Option B is the most logical. It addresses the noise leakage and the outside hire costs, while avoiding the hygiene nightmare that Option A would inevitably create. Efficiency and professionalism must come first.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I think Option B makes sense too. If we have a proper meeting space, we can stop spending that 68,000 yen on outside rentals. It seems like the safest choice for our budget.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Rin,,"I want Option B too! If we have a calendar, then everyone gets a turn and it's not just the people by the door. Plus, no one has to clean up gross fridge stuff!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Servas,,"While Option B provides a structure for our work, let us ensure it is not merely a place for agendas, but a sanctuary for our hearts to speak and our bonds to grow.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Toshio,,"Option B is the only sustainable choice. It eliminates the recurring cost of outside rentals and, unlike Option A, does not introduce a permanent maintenance burden that will inevitably fall on a few.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Shion,,"It seems we have reached a rare moment of total consensus. @Servas, as long as the room is used for meaningful connection, the structure of Option B does not hinder that. It is the only choice that solves all our problems.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I feel much better now that we're all agreeing. If we go with Option B, we can finally stop those monthly payments and have a clear budget. I'll vote for the meeting space.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Rin,,Me too! A calendar is like a game where everyone gets a fair turn! I'm voting for Option B because it's the most fair and the cleanest! Yay!,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Servas,,"I shall join you all in voting for Option B. Let us promise that this room will be used not only for business, but as a bridge to turn our strangers into friends.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Toshio,,I agree. Option B minimizes the risk of hidden labor costs and solves the financial leak of outside rentals. It is the most efficient and sustainable path forward. I vote for Option B.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Shion,,"Since the logic is sound and the consensus is absolute, there is no reason to prolong this. I vote for Option B. It is the only solution that restores the professional integrity of our workspace.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Daisuke,,I'll vote for Option B as well. It's a relief that we've found a way to stop the outside costs and keep things organized. I'm glad we could all agree on this.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Rin,,"I'm voting for Option B too! It's the best way to make sure everyone gets to use the room and nobody has to be the ""cleaning hero"" all by themselves!","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Servas,,I cast my vote for Option B. May this space become a garden where our relationships bloom and where we may speak our truths with kindness and courage.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Toshio,,I vote for Option B. It is the only choice that ensures we are not trading one financial cost for a hidden cost of labor and upkeep.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Shion,,"The decision is unanimous. Option B is the only choice that logically addresses the noise, the cost, and the hygiene issues. I believe we have reached the most efficient conclusion possible.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
