77,3,4,talk,Daisuke,,I'm just glad we could settle this without any arguments. I'll help with the paperwork for the fit-out if that helps. I vote for Option B.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
