79,3,4,talk,Rin,,I'm so happy we all agree! No more mystery leftovers and no more fighting over who gets the room first! I vote for Option B!,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
